<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Batöni waterfall arena — Weisstannen–western Gufelbach–Batöni bridge return</name><desc>Start at the walking trail in Weisstannen Oberdorf and follow the Gufelbach on the marked approach to Batöni. Use the western streamside path into the waterfall arena, cross the full suspension bridge to the far bank, and return by the same marked trail.

